{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/d6d1d160bd05bf5f69ae45f9272f019c.poster.avif?t=1772478049\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/d6d1d160bd05bf5f69ae45f9272f019c.webm?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/d6d1d160bd05bf5f69ae45f9272f019c.mp4?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Slash, dash, and blast your way through fast-paced puzzles &amp; precise platforming challenges! Dream Runner's platforming style is easy to learn, but tough to master. Juggle &amp; refresh your abilities to chain together long, satisfying combos and fly through the air.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/54cda901e067077c11a3fdd2aa4d34e4.poster.avif?t=1772478049\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/54cda901e067077c11a3fdd2aa4d34e4.webm?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/54cda901e067077c11a3fdd2aa4d34e4.mp4?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Discover abilities one at a time and learn new ways to use your power! Use Dream Flowers to upgrade and mutate your abilities, opening new paths and transforming the way you navigate.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/4d14aa99db810304d9762c43b5893bf9.poster.avif?t=1772478049\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/4d14aa99db810304d9762c43b5893bf9.webm?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/4d14aa99db810304d9762c43b5893bf9.mp4?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and catch hidden unique butterflies to befriend along your adventure! Caught butterflies follow  and interact with you as you platforming through the game's story and arcade mode. Butterflies of all shapes, colors,  sizes, and personalities are hiding throughout the game's worlds, so be sure to look in every nook and cranny to find your favorite!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/13ab03c1d815a8393af37b7e0f17e32a.poster.avif?t=1772478049\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/13ab03c1d815a8393af37b7e0f17e32a.webm?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/extras/13ab03c1d815a8393af37b7e0f17e32a.mp4?t=1772478049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>From quiet forests to dreamy cloudscapes,  dark dungeons to blistering tundras, explore a vast, carefully crafted world full of whimsy and challenging terrain. Venture through hidden paths to uncover the world's secrets and reveal mysteries lurking just beneath the surface. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Two Games</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dream Runner is split into two modes of play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure Mode</strong> - <i>A Game about Growing Up</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Soma and Nigel are childhood best friends. But as they're getting older, they're finding themselves growing in totally different directions. As Nigel and Soma's friendship is tested, they accidentally uncover a dark conspiracy within their village. Now, with both his friendship and his  forest home at stake, Soma  must learn to step up and save everything from complete disaster.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode</strong> - <i>Brutally Intense Speedrunning Levels</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a flurry of short-and-not-so-sweet arcade-style levels that will push the game's mechanics to their limits and put your skills to the test. Look for  secrets hidden in each level and practice runs to win based on completion time.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035870?t=1772478049","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3035870?t=1772478049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/c143223cd04279ac6d0b6b290f93dab970ed9434/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772478049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/c143223cd04279ac6d0b6b290f93dab970ed9434/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772478049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3775620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com