ldhood best friends. But as they're getting older, they're finding themselves growing in totally different directions. As Nigel and Soma's friendship is tested, they accidentally uncover a dark conspiracy within their village. Now, with both his friendship and his  forest home at stake, Soma  must learn to step up and save everything from complete disaster.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode</strong> - <i>Brutally Intense Speedrunning Levels</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a flurry of short-and-not-so-sweet arcade-style levels that will push the game's mechanics to their limits and put your skills to the test. Look for  secrets hidden in each level and practice runs to win based on completion time.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Glass Arcade"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3035870/3af30385f0bad096ec9377cd4ad0ccd1254d3be2/header.jpg?t=1772478049","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Lion 10.7.5, 32/64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0+<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"Dream Runner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 M380<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":true,"windows":true},"publishers":["Glass Arcade"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantas