cd342.600x338.jpg?t=1772478049"}],"short_description":"Soma is just a kid who doesn't want to grow up. Test your limits in this fast and whimsical platformer where new challenges wait around every corner! Master powerful abilities, solve puzzles, and catch butterflies, all while unearthing a dark conspiracy hidden just beneath the surface.","steam_appid":3035870,"support_info":{"email":"contact@glass-arcade.com","url":"https://glass-arcade.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://glass-arcade.com/"}